      "writtenOn": "2026-01-21T19:44:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When does this exception occur? When the calling user is different from the context user? Can we instead check the user before calling getMainDisplayIdAssignedToUser()?\n\nWe should avoid relying on exceptions for normal operations if possible.",
