        "id": 2042336
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-23T08:44:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The getMainDisplayIdAssignedToUser API checks whether the caller has the INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS permission,\nand will throw a SecurityException if the permission is missing.  \nWe do not want this SecurityException to affect the flow in this context.\n\nIn the MUMD project, we currently do not have a good solution for this issue.  \nIf you have any better suggestions, we would appreciate your analysis and advice.\nThank you very much.",
